Error [E0209]: implicit clone of `e.addr`
  --> tests/ui/core_consuming_borrowed_field.jet:11:22
    |
 11 |     return Data.Text(e.addr)
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: `Text` stores its own copy of this value
 Fix: write `copy e.addr` to copy explicitly

